            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kw’o kwauma andũ maana thanthatũ mekĩe mĩio ya kaũ ma mũvĩa wa Andani, kuma ku Nzola, na kuma Esitaoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mambata, na mamba maeema ku Kiliathi‐yealimu, nthĩnĩ wa Yuta: kwondũ wa ũu maveta vandũ vau Maane‐ndani kũvika ũmũnthĩ; sisya, yĩ ĩtina wa Kiliathi‐yealimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
