        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Ndani meeũngamĩsya ũla mũvw’anano mwasũvye; na Yonathani, mwana wa Ngelisoni, mwana wa Mose, we na ana make maĩ athembi kwa mbaĩ ya Ndani kũvika mũthenya wa kũtavwa kwa nthĩ ĩsu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuma 2.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
